  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Coy Caster</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You do not treat spellcasters or creatures under the effects of magic sphere effects as observing you for the purpose of your Coy Caster drawback. While you are observed by a creature which would force a concentration check from the Coy Caster drawback, you gain a +2 competence bonus to your MSB to affect the sphere abilities of other spellcasters.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc86\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
